--[[ TITAN GIANT MECH  -  FE brick mech (Delta / any executor)
  * Built ONLY from your own unanchored, unwelded 1x1x3 bricks. 100 minimum, 300 maximum.
    Builds the biggest version your count allows:  100 | 180 | 220 | 285 | 300
  * Every brick is pinned to the rig every frame (CFrame + anti-gravity force) so nothing ever falls.
  * SIZE 1x - 10x: the rig scales up and the bricks spread out (brick size cannot be changed from the
    client), so big sizes look like a floating "constellation" mech. 1x-3x looks the most solid.
  * Magazine = 10 bricks on the back pods. They are the missiles AND the laser beam.
  * Sword (20-ish bricks) is stowed on the back; EQUIP draws it. All projectiles are non-colliding (no damage / no knockback).

  ABILITIES  (button / key)
    sword OFF : Shot [Q] (10 ammo + Reload [T]) | Punch [F] | Roar [R] | Slam [G]
    sword ON  : Spin [Q] | Slash [F] | Pose [R] | Slam [G]
    always    : Laser [L] | Equip sword [E] | Reload [T]
  GUI: "M" button or RightControl toggles the panel; drag by the title.
  FE : positions / animation / flying bricks are seen by everyone. Colors, glow, cutscene, effects are local only.
       Tip: paint your bricks with the game's paint tool first if you want others to see a colored mech.
]]

